# TravelAO

Project path: `~/Projects/TravelAO`.

## Product
Trip planner for **couple / friends / family**. Inputs: relationship, dates, budget, purpose (+ optional destination/notes). Output: full plan (transport, hotels, itinerary, restaurants, sights, budget, practical notes).

## Default mode: offline, no API key
The web UI must work **without any API key**. Plans are generated in-browser by `public/planner.js` (`generatePlan`). Do not make cloud LLM keys required again unless the user explicitly asks for an optional LLM toggle.

## Docs to read on resume
- `docs/SESSION.md` — handoff
- `docs/PREFERENCES.md` — decisions
- `docs/PROJECT-FLOW.md` — architecture

## Run
`cd ~/Projects/TravelAO && npm start` → http://localhost:3000

## Do not
- Commit `.env`, API keys, or personal booking files
- Break the offline Generate plan path
